---
import LegalLayout from '~/layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
---

<LegalLayout title="Refund Policy">
  <p class="page-updated">Last Updated: March 17, 2026</p>

  <p>
    We want you to be happy with your purchase. If you're not satisfied with Skill Check Premium, here's how refunds
    work.
  </p>

  <h2>How to Request a Refund</h2>
  <p>
    Email <a href="mailto:support@ki10games.com">support@ki10games.com</a> with your account email and the reason for your
    request. We aim to respond within 48 hours.
  </p>

  <h2>Refund Window</h2>
  <p>
    You may request a full refund within <strong>14 days</strong> of your purchase, no questions asked. After 14 days, refunds
    are handled on a case-by-case basis.
  </p>

  <h2>What Happens After a Refund</h2>
  <p>
    Once a refund is processed, your account will be reverted to the free tier. Premium features including archive
    access, cloud saves, replay functionality, and theme submissions will be disabled. Your game progress and collection
    data will not be deleted.
  </p>

  <h2>Payment Processor</h2>
  <p>
    All payments and refunds are processed through <strong>Polar</strong>, our Merchant of Record. Refunds typically
    appear on your statement within 5–10 business days depending on your payment provider.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
